      'what is the difference between a military occupation and a puppet state direct foreign military administration versus nominally independent government controlled from outside collaborationist regime Vichy Manchukuo',
      'a MILITARY OCCUPATION is when a foreign power takes DIRECT physical and administrative control of a territory with its own troops and often its own military governor the territory has no independent government of its own the occupier openly runs it examples German occupied northern France 1940 to 1944 Allied occupation of Germany and Japan after 1945',
